uss e recupere o desempenho e a estabilidade do seu motor Ford!', 476.99, 476.99, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Injection', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-7r98o-m5kt2go8ct3kbf', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1272573624%2F19297736476', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
